{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "fixture_license": "CC0-1.0",
  "document_id": "unit-ferry",
  "source_document_revision": "ferry-r1",
  "sha256_hex": "1ad305232df216f36b6cfa5d65db1e5665f704ccf9e60f9577cc392647d018ae",
  "utf8_byte_count": 1322,
  "chapters": [
    {
      "chapter_id": "ch_001",
      "title": "第一章 试铃",
      "source_span": {
        "unit": "utf8_byte",
        "start": 0,
        "end_exclusive": 627
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "segment_id": "s1_01",
          "source_span": {
            "unit": "utf8_byte",
            "start": 0,
            "end_exclusive": 17
          },
          "source_text": "第一章 试铃\n",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "s1_02",
          "source_span": {
            "unit": "utf8_byte",
            "start": 17,
            "end_exclusive": 192
          },
          "source_text": "长乐渡口的雾压着石阶。岑禾蹲在第三块青砖上，把小铜铃系进水尺的空孔。她在木盒盖上写下一行字，又用袖口擦去最后一个点。\n",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "s1_03",
          "source_span": {
            "unit": "utf8_byte",
            "start": 192,
            "end_exclusive": 231
          },
          "source_text": "“阿禾，铃离水还有几寸？”",
          "speaker_id": "wen"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "s1_04",
          "source_span": {
            "unit": "utf8_byte",
            "start": 231,
            "end_exclusive": 319
          },
          "source_text": "闻舟把船篙横在膝头。他守了二十年夜渡，岸上人都叫他舟师傅。\n",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "s1_05",
          "source_span": {
            "unit": "utf8_byte",
            "start": 319,
            "end_exclusive": 364
          },
          "source_text": "两寸。你听，先响的那一声是风。",
          "speaker_id": "cen"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "s1_06",
          "source_span": {
            "unit": "utf8_byte",
            "start": 364,
            "end_exclusive": 386
          },
          "source_text": "岑禾没有回头。\n",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "s1_07",
          "source_span": {
            "unit": "utf8_byte",
            "start": 386,
            "end_exclusive": 419
          },
          "source_text": "“那我这盏灯挂错了。”",
          "speaker_id": "mu"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "s1_08",
          "source_span": {
            "unit": "utf8_byte",
            "start": 419,
            "end_exclusive": 543
          },
          "source_text": "穆青从铺门上解下风灯。青掌柜记账从不用墨，算盘下压着的白纸却画满了一大一小的圆圈。\n",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "s1_09",
          "source_span": {
            "unit": "utf8_byte",
            "start": 543,
            "end_exclusive": 627
          },
          "source_text": "“大圈记船，小圈记空渡。昨夜有12只小圈，船一趟也没开。”\n",
          "speaker_id": "mu"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter_id": "ch_002",
      "title": "第二章 回音",
      "source_span": {
        "unit": "utf8_byte",
        "start": 627,
        "end_exclusive": 1322
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "segment_id": "s2_01",
          "source_span": {
            "unit": "utf8_byte",
            "start": 627,
            "end_exclusive": 644
          },
          "source_text": "第二章 回音\n",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "s2_02",
          "source_span": {
            "unit": "utf8_byte",
            "start": 644,
            "end_exclusive": 822
          },
          "source_text": "重逢时天已经亮了。三个人沿着退水留下的泥线走到桥洞，发现一片瓦正搭在旧铁管的口上。瓦边有条窄缝，恰好能穿过一根湿麻线。\n",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "s2_03",
          "source_span": {
            "unit": "utf8_byte",
            "start": 822,
            "end_exclusive": 864
          },
          "source_text": "“我把瓦抬高，你再拉一次。”",
          "speaker_id": "wen"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "s2_04",
          "source_span": {
            "unit": "utf8_byte",
            "start": 864,
            "end_exclusive": 910
          },
          "source_text": "舟师傅侧过身，让出一小块干地。\n",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "s2_05",
          "source_span": {
            "unit": "utf8_byte",
            "start": 910,
            "end_exclusive": 955
          },
          "source_text": "“先别动，我要把这一声留下。”",
          "speaker_id": "cen"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "s2_06",
          "source_span": {
            "unit": "utf8_byte",
            "start": 955,
            "end_exclusive": 1077
          },
          "source_text": "阿禾按下录音盒上写着Echo的白键。铃响以后，洞里慢慢答了一声，像有人拿指甲轻叩空碗。\n",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "s2_07",
          "source_span": {
            "unit": "utf8_byte",
            "start": 1077,
            "end_exclusive": 1110
          },
          "source_text": "原来那些空渡都在这里。",
          "speaker_id": "mu"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "s2_08",
          "source_span": {
            "unit": "utf8_byte",
            "start": 1110,
            "end_exclusive": 1180
          },
          "source_text": "青掌柜把纸翻过来，在背面认认真真画了一只耳朵。\n",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "s2_09",
          "source_span": {
            "unit": "utf8_byte",
            "start": 1180,
            "end_exclusive": 1228
          },
          "source_text": "“往后雾再大，也能听着回家了。”",
          "speaker_id": "wen"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "s2_10",
          "source_span": {
            "unit": "utf8_byte",
            "start": 1228,
            "end_exclusive": 1322
          },
          "source_text": "闻舟收起船篙。最后一滴水顺着麻线落进河心，岸上没有人急着开口。\n",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
